  <bpmn:task id="Bridge_6_8afc" name="Here are two options for a concise transition sentence connecting the processes:&#10;&#10;**Option 1 (Focus on the Cancellation Event):**&#10;&gt; Following the cancellation and deactivation of a subscription in Process A, the customer may later initiate Process B by making a new inquiry about products or services.&#10;&#10;**Option 2 (Focus on the Outcome):**&#10;&gt; Process A concludes with the customer's departure; if this former customer later inquires about offerings again, it directly triggers the start of Process B." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_6" sourceRef="atom_5_ExclusiveGateway_2" targetRef="Bridge_6_8afc" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_6" sourceRef="Bridge_6_8afc" targetRef="atom_6_Task_5" /></bpmn:process>
